LICENSOR GRANTS YOU A FREE, NON-EXCLUSIVE, NON-TRANSFERABLE, REVOCABLE LICENSE TO DOWNLOAD, INSTALL, AND USE THE SOFTWARE FOR ANY PERSONAL, EDUCATIONAL, OR COMMERCIAL PURPOSE, STRICTLY IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE TERMS OF THIS AGREEMENT.

