A) SELL, RENT, LEASE, OR SUB-LICENSE THE SOFTWARE ITSELF AS A STANDALONE PRODUCT.
B) REVERSE ENGINEER, DECOMPILE, OR DISASSEMBLE THE SOFTWARE (EXCEPT TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW OR OPEN-SOURCE LICENSES INCLUDED WITH SPECIFIC COMPONENTS).
